OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist, 37, dies after bike
OL,4,Aleaves road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after the motorcycle he
OL,7,Fwas riding left the road.
OL,9,FThe crash happened on the A15, near the
OL,10,FBroughton interchange in North
OL,11,FLincolnshire, just before 20:00 BST on
OL,12,FTuesday, Humberside Police said.
OL,14,FThe motorcyclist was travelling between
OL,15,Fthe M180 junction 4 roundabout and the
OL,16,FA18 roundabout at Mortal Ash Hill when
OL,17,Fhis vehicle left the road and came to a
OL,18,Fstop on a grass verge.
OL,20,FThe rider of the blue Suzuki motorbike,
OL,21,Fa 37-year-old man, died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
